ona","publishedAt":"2026-11-04T13:50:43.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"朝鲜黑客通过THORChain清洗币安被盗资金，RUNE单日涨超10%","summary":"朝鲜黑客通过THORChain将币安被盗资金转换为BTC，RUNE单日涨超10.6%。攻击者将SOL分散至多个钱包，兑换为USDC后转入以太坊，最终通过THORChain以约4830万美元套现。币安已冻结约28.5亿美元资金。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1a6c2-00cb-70e4-80e5-86407da2e504","publishedAt":"2026-11-04T13:31:34.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"ifhct3b4tngoddq6np1tlcgwl"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"比特币在中期选举后经历 V 型复苏，单日跌幅超 4% 至 $75,630","summary":"比特币在中期选举后单日暴跌超4%至$75,630，随后快速反弹。CLARITY法案因两党支持在参议院受阻，若2027年1月前无法推进，将延迟加密资产监管框架落地。同期现货比特币ETF出现超10亿美元净流出，反映机构对政策不确定性的担忧。分析师Markus Thielen预测比特币将反弹至$82,000，但提醒需警惕$70,000-$75,000区间二次回踩。","sourceName":"Crypto Briefing","sourceUrl":"https://cryptobriefing.com/bitcoin-v-shaped-recovery-midterm-dip/","publishedAt":"2026-11-04T06:20:49.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37ea346353e612445d84b46266c2d66f6c1804dcbe725a99a35373e78ce4a3bf.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/e305f14ac3c89a8eea5964e7526b7ce6185e048a2b6a69dc244016bd8d40f48b.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37ea346353e612445d84b46266c2d66f6c1804dcbe725a99a35373e78ce4a3bf.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"比特币反弹：民主党赢得国会后价格回升至76K以下","summary":null,"sourceName":"Cointelegraph","sourceUrl":"https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-bounces-from-7-week-low-under-76k-as-democrats-eye-congress-sweep?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound","publishedAt":"202